{"id":"e1cdd4c4623e324f","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-m-complete-creative.md","title":"M-Complete Implies Creative","display":"thm-m-complete-creative — M-Complete Implies Creative","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-m-complete-creative","aliases":["92-thm-m-complete-creative"],"display":"thm-m-complete-creative — M-Complete Implies Creative","depends_on":["[[92-df-m-complete]]","[[92-df-creative-set]]","[[92-df-halting-set]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]"],"source":"原书之外的 c.e. 集结构与生产力背景；须采用已指定的可接受编号，创造性结论不是任意相容理论的无条件性质","source_status":"外部递归论定义或定理"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-m-complete-creative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-m-complete-creative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-m-complete-creative — M-Complete Implies Creative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" href=\"?note=9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" title=\"92-df-m-complete\">92-df-m-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9d6396579de4ff0\" href=\"?note=c9d6396579de4ff0\" title=\"92-df-creative-set\">92-df-creative-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的 c.e. 集结构与生产力背景；须采用已指定的可接受编号，创造性结论不是任意相容理论的无条件性质"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部递归论定义或定理"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\)</span> (m-complete, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" href=\"?note=9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" title=\"92-df-m-complete\">92-df-m-complete</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> (creative-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c9d6396579de4ff0\" href=\"?note=c9d6396579de4ff0\" title=\"92-df-creative-set\">92-df-creative-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多一完全r.e.集是创造集</li>\n<li>证明：\n<ol>\n<li>设<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>多一完全，所有r.e.集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m A\">\\(\\leq_m A\\)</span></li>\n<li>利用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的多一完备性，把任意候选枚举集统一归约到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span></li>\n<li>再用参数定理与递归定理把该归约自指化，得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\setminus A\">\\(\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\)</span>的生产力函数</li>\n<li>多一归约通常没有可计算逆，证明不能使用原先写出的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}\">\\(f^{-1}\\)</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>逆命题也成立：在固定可接受编号下，c.e.集创造当且仅当多一完全；本原子只陈述所标明的正向蕴涵</li>\n<li>标准停机集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>是创造集；某个理论的定理码集是否创造，取决于该理论的有效性、表达能力与一致性等附加条件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>在同一可接受程序编号下取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=\\{n:\\varphi_n(n)\\downarrow\\}\">\\(K=\\{n:\\varphi_n(n)\\downarrow\\}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\">\\(W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\)</span>；c.e. 枚举可有效互译。由多一完全性取总递归 f，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in K\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in A\">\\(n\\in K\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in A\\)</span>。\n令 q(e,n) 是一个程序的索引：对任意输入，等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)\">\\(f(n)\\)</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 枚举后返回 0。参数定理使 q 总递归。为明确统一自指的来源，令 s(u,x) 为把二元程序 u 的第一输入固定为 x 的索引函数；有效取得二元程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_e\">\\(u_e\\)</span>，其行为是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\psi_e(x,y)=\\varphi_{q(e,s(x,x))}(y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\psi_e(x,y)=\\varphi_{q(e,s(x,x))}(y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(e)=s(u_e,u_e)\">\\(n(e)=s(u_e,u_e)\\)</span>。代入可得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{n(e)}(y)=\\varphi_{q(e,n(e))}(y)\">\\(\\varphi_{n(e)}(y)=\\varphi_{q(e,n(e))}(y)\\)</span>，且 n 是总递归；故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(e)\\in K\\leftrightarrow f(n(e))\\in W_e\">\\(n(e)\\in K\\leftrightarrow f(n(e))\\in W_e\\)</span>。\n定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)=f(n(e))\">\\(p(e)=f(n(e))\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A\">\\(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)\\in W_e\">\\(p(e)\\in W_e\\)</span>，就有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(e)\\in K\">\\(n(e)\\in K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)\\in A\">\\(p(e)\\in A\\)</span>，矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)\\notin W_e\">\\(p(e)\\notin W_e\\)</span>；又由该双条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(e)\\notin K\">\\(n(e)\\notin K\\)</span>，进而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)\\notin A\">\\(p(e)\\notin A\\)</span>。p 是总递归的生产力函数。连同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\)</span>，全程未使用 f 的逆。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-m-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-creative-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)$ (m-complete, see [[92-df-m-complete]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Creative}$ (creative-set predicate, see [[92-df-creative-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Creative}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K=\\{n:\\varphi_n(n)\\downarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in K\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"u_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_e(x,y)=\\varphi_{q(e,s(x,x))}(y).","display":true},{"tex":"n(e)=s(u_e,u_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{n(e)}(y)=\\varphi_{q(e,n(e))}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"n(e)\\in K\\leftrightarrow f(n(e))\\in W_e","display":false},{"tex":"p(e)=f(n(e))","display":false},{"tex":"W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"p(e)\\in W_e","display":false},{"tex":"n(e)\\in K","display":false},{"tex":"p(e)\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"p(e)\\notin W_e","display":false},{"tex":"n(e)\\notin K","display":false},{"tex":"p(e)\\notin A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":2669,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-m-complete-creative]]"}],"outgoing":["9f063fb5c2ee3d66","c9d6396579de4ff0","06a154edf19ea063","d65795dc15ebce4b"]}